      <string key="4">{scroll 2}\nA faucet.{scroll 2}</string>
      <string key="5">{scroll 2}Will you put water in the\nempty bottle?{branch 0 1 1}{scroll 2}There's a UMB.No2.{clear 0}Will you put UMB No.2 in the\nempty bottle?{branch 0 1 1}{scroll 2}There's a UMB.No4.{clear 0}Will you put UMB No.4 in the\nempty bottle?{branch 0 1 1}{scroll 2}There's UMB No.2. You need\na container to obtain it.{scroll 2}</string>
